sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant WEB as Web app
    participant C as AI assistant
    participant M as MCP server
    participant S as Tools service
    U->>WEB: create token
    WEB-->>U: token (shown once)
    U->>C: configure URL + token
    C->>M: list_tools (Bearer token)
